      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 5.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "morning, you know, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.73,
      "end_seconds": 12.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "yes, come in, take a a seat what can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.26,
      "end_seconds": 18.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Well, you know, I've been having pain in my lower back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.27,
      "end_seconds": 29.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "how long has this been going on? It helps to be thorough at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.06,
      "end_seconds": 36.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Around three days... no wait, you know, it's more like two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.56,
      "end_seconds": 42.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Does anything bring it it on or make it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.46,
      "end_seconds": 49.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Sitting for long and bending definitely sets it off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.07,
      "end_seconds": 58.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "have you had numbness in the legs, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.38,
      "end_seconds": 64.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Not at all, no numbness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.84,
      "end_seconds": 72.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Let me check a a few things. Any weight loss, bladder problems or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.54,
      "end_seconds": 77.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "no, no weight loss, bladder problems or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.99,
      "end_seconds": 81.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.67,
      "end_seconds": 84.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.02,
      "end_seconds": 87.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.55,
      "end_seconds": 90.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.63,
      "end_seconds": 111.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.92,
      "end_seconds": 116.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.01,
      "end_seconds": 119.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.59,
      "end_seconds": 125.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.74,
      "end_seconds": 130.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "do you have a job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.1,
      "end_seconds": 133.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "I'm a self-employed electrician"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.4,
      "end_seconds": 146.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.99,
      "end_seconds": 150.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "nothing, uh, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.81,
      "end_seconds": 153.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "first the numbers, if you don't mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.61,
      "end_seconds": 168.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Okay, give me a a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.17,
      "end_seconds": 190.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.4 degrees, pulse is 75 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, BP is 113 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.94,
      "end_seconds": 193.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.58,
      "end_seconds": 197.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "So, I'll come back to those numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.71,
      "end_seconds": 202.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Let's do the physical part now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.27,
      "end_seconds": 206.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me look at this properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.27,
      "end_seconds": 228.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Straight leg raise is negative on both sides and power in the legs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.36,
      "end_seconds": 233.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let me look at this properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.89,
      "end_seconds": 247.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "there's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.34,
      "end_seconds": 254.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.32,
      "end_seconds": 283.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, my working impression is mechanical low back pain. Let's book an MRI of the lumbar spine to look into persistent back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.48,
      "end_seconds": 290.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "So, does it need any preparation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.46,
      "end_seconds": 305.64,
      "duration_seconds": 13.18,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an X-ray of the lower back because of back pain. It's a routine test and and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.18,
      "end_seconds": 309.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Does it need any preparation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.35,
      "end_seconds": 329.96,
      "duration_seconds": 19.61,
      "text": "Let's use paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for one week. It's for back pain. Staying gently active heals back pain faster than bed rest, so keep moving. Every hour, get up and stretch if you're at a desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.35,
      "end_seconds": 343.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.45,
      "text": "Okay. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. We'll catch up in two weeks. Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.39,
      "end_seconds": 349.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Well, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.07,
      "end_seconds": 351.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Bye for now."
    }
  ]
